[gd_resource type="InputActions" format=3]

; Godot's built-in input actions (ui_*): the data of InputMap::get_builtins() (#172).
; An InputActions resource in the text resource format; it opens in the Inspector.
; The build turns it into core/input/builtin_input_actions.gen.cpp (make_builtin_input_actions() in
; core/input/input_builders.py); it is not loaded at runtime and not exported.
; Platform variants: an action whose name ends with a feature tag (ui_close_dialog.macos) replaces the
; action of the plain name when OS.has_feature() is true for the tag, like the input/ui_*.<tag> project settings.
; Events are sub-resources: InputEventKey (keycode, modifier flags), InputEventJoypadButton (button_index)
; and InputEventJoypadMotion (axis, axis_value). Edit this file as text: saving it from the editor
; writes the events as InputAction.bindings, which the build does not read.

